\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-Japan's foreign reserves rise to record high. \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 2001\par 03:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Aug 7 (Reuters) - Japan's foreign reserves rose to a record $367.676 billion at the end of July, surpassing the previous high of $364.219 billion in January, a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The reserves rose $5.010 billion in July from $362.666 a month earlier, reflecting the rise in the euro against the dollar during the month that helped to lift the reserves, he said. \par \par \uc2  Japan retained its position as the holder of the world's foreign reserves for the 20th consecutive month. \par \par \uc2  "The euro's gains against the dollar were the major factor behind the rise in the reserves," the official told reporters. \par \par \uc2  The euro rose 3.04 percent to as high as $0.8756 in July from $0.8498 at the end of June. \par \par \uc2  The MOF said it conducted no \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the April-June quarter. In \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducts \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the Finance Ministry's behalf. \par \par \uc2  The ministry said in mid-July that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on September 22, 2000 when it conducted euro-buying/yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with a volume of 143.5 billion yen. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  jointly stepped into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market that time to buy euros with other Group of Seven nations to help to stem a decline in the single European \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010807dx87002gx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
