\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Yen recovers from one month low after BOJ warning. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Sumeet Desai \par \uc2 532 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juni 2001\par 10:04\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      LONDON, June 19 (Reuters) - The dollar retreated from \par \par \uc2  one-month highs against the yen on Tuesday after Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  Governor Masaru Hayami warned \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might be \par \par \uc2  needed if exchange rates moved too rapidly. \par \par \uc2  Hayami also said Japan should not drive the yen lower due to \par \par \uc2  the impact on neighbouring countries and his comments succeeded \par \par \uc2  in driving the dollar down about 1/3 yen. \par \par \uc2  Still, analysts said the yen was likely to stay under \par \par \uc2  pressure in the coming days because of persistent worries over \par \par \uc2  the health of the Japanese economy which had undermined it \par \par \uc2  earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  "The Hayami comments show Japan doesn't want to see the yen \par \par \uc2  rapidly weaker. That's because of concern about the \par \par \uc2  destabilising effect it would have on the economy," said Derk \par \par \uc2  Halpenny, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at Bank of Tokyo Mitsubishi. \par \par \uc2      "But until we get a clear presentation of policy the market \par \par \uc2  is going to be sceptical of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he added. \par \par \uc2      Hayami's warning on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  also sent the euro down \par \par \uc2  against the yen to the day's lows below 106 yen, pushing it even \par \par \uc2  further down against the dollar. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     At 0710 GMT, the dollar was trading around 123.40 yen\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and $0.8580 per euro . Euro/yen was at 105.88 yen\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Earlier, the dollar crept up as high as 123.80 yen, having\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ridden over Monday's high of 123.52 yen and was about a half yen\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par higher than 123.26 yen in late New York trade.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said the yen suffered as the market fretted over the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par pain the Japanese economy would have to go through to tackle\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par structural reforms.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Rumours of a corporate failure at a Japanese retailer or\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par construction company also helped the dollar climb against the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Traders said shares of Japan's fourth-largest supermarket\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Mycal Corp were coming under pressure on market\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par concerns about its financial health. A company spokeswoman said\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the talk was groundless.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The yen had been bought from April to May on the euphoria\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par based on the idea that the economy will improve if Prime\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Minister (Junichiro) Koizumi carries out structural reforms,"\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said Naoto Ohnuma, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  manager at Mitsubishi Corp\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in Tokyo.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "But the market is now turning to the reality. If Koizumi\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par does implement reforms, there will be more bankruptcies, and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par unemployment will be a lot higher," Ohnuma said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     EUROZONE DATA AWAITED\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Traders were waiting for release of euro zone industrial\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par production figures at 1000 GMT. Average forecasts are for output\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to fall a further 0.6 percent on the month after a 0.2 percent\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par drop in March.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Traders said the single \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  continued to suffer from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par evidence of slowing growth and rising inflation.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "There's not much demand to buy euros out there," said\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Halpenny.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Traders said the market was probing key support for the euro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par at $0.8550.70.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     There was still a lingering concern about possible ECB\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , particularly after Sweden's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  acted\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par aggressively to support its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Riksbank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  for a second straight trading\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par session on Monday lifting the krona to three-week highs by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par selling both dollars and euros.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6j01fh6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
