\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Yen finds footing courtesy of BOJ's Hayami. \b0\par\par\uc2 489 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juni 2001\par 12:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      (Updates prices, adds fresh quotes, euro zone data, changes \par \par \uc2  byline) \par \par \uc2      By Carolyn Cohn \par \par \uc2      LONDON, June 19 (Reuters) - The yen recovered from one-month \par \par \uc2  lows against the dollar on Tuesday after Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor \par \par \uc2  Masaru Hayami said \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might be needed if \par \par \uc2  exchange rates moved too rapidly. \par \par \uc2      Hayami also said Japan should not drive the yen lower due to \par \par \uc2  the impact on neighbouring countries. \par \par \uc2      His comments succeeded in pushing the yen up by more than \par \par \uc2  half a percent from its lows against the dollar and Japan's \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also rallied to the week's highs against a broadly weak \par \par \uc2  euro. \par \par \uc2  "The Hayami comments show Japan doesn't want to see the yen \par \par \uc2  rapidly weaker. That's because of concern about the \par \par \uc2  destabilising effect it would have on the economy," said Derek \par \par \uc2  Halpenny, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi. \par \par \uc2      "But until we get a clear presentation of policy the market \par \par \uc2  is going to be sceptical of Japan," he added. \par \par \uc2      The dollar was trading at the day's lows around 122.80 yen \par \par \uc2   at 1000 GMT, according to Reuters data, and the euro was \par \par \uc2  also at its lows against the yen around 105.25 . \par \par \uc2      The euro, meanwhile, weakened to five-day lows against the \par \par \uc2  dollar on continuing gloom about the euro zone economic \par \par \uc2  outlook, and was trading in a crucial support band of \par \par \uc2  $0.8550/70. \par \par \uc2      ECONOMIC PAIN \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the yen suffered in Tokyo trade as the market \par \par \uc2  fretted over the pain the Japanese economy would have to go \par \par \uc2  through to tackle structural reforms. \par \par \uc2      Rumours of a corporate failure at a Japanese retailer or \par \par \uc2  construction company also helped the dollar in Asia. \par \par \uc2      Shares of Japan's fourth-largest supermarket operator Mycal \par \par \uc2  Corp hit record lows on Tuesday on market concerns \par \par \uc2  about its financial health. A company spokeswoman said the talk \par \par \uc2  was groundless, aiding the yen's recovery in Europe, traders \par \par \uc2  said. \par \par \uc2      WATCHING CENTRAL BANKS \par \par \uc2      Traders said the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued to suffer from \par \par \uc2  evidence of slowing growth and rising inflation. \par \par \uc2      Euro zone industrial production data released on Tuesday \par \par \uc2  fell 0.5 percent in April and rose 1.6 percent year-on-year, its \par \par \uc2  slowest year-on-year rise since July 1999. \par \par \uc2      "There's not much demand to buy euros out there," said \par \par \uc2  Halpenny. \par \par \uc2      But the euro found support from lingering concern about \par \par \uc2  possible European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , particularly after \par \par \uc2  Sweden's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  acted aggressively to support its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  this week. \par \par \uc2  "The Riksbank is a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a weak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \par \par \uc2  rising inflation, and rather than raising interest rates, it has \par \par \uc2  been forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Teis Knuthsen, chief strategist \par \par \uc2  at SEB Merchant Banking in Copenhagen. \par \par \uc2  "The same model works for the ECB." \par \par \uc2  The Riksbank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for a second straight trading \par \par \uc2  session on Monday, lifting the crown to three-week highs by \par \par \uc2  buying the crown for both dollars and euros . \par \par \uc2  The crown hovered below those highs on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6j01faj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
