\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Euro stems the losses but downtrend remains. \b0\par\par\uc2      By Daniel Bases \par \uc2 846 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juni 2001\par 23:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      NEW YORK, June 1 (Reuters) - The euro stopped bleeding \par \par \uc2  value against the dollar and yen on Friday after a better than \par \par \uc2  expected U.S. employment report for May sent the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \par \par \uc2  its lowest level of the year for the second consecutive day. \par \par \uc2  The euro managed to turn in marginal gains after falling \par \par \uc2  sharply on Thursday when the prospects for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  were blurred by comments from their officials. \par \par \uc2  The single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's woes began in Asian trade on Friday, \par \par \uc2  when it dropped below 100 yen for the first time in five \par \par \uc2  months, helping the yen extend rapid and broad gains after \par \par \uc2  Japanese Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa said recent \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves did not warrant \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But Europe's common \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  capitulated to selling \par \par \uc2  pressure that had been building since early in the session \par \par \uc2  after the U.S. Labor Department reported that employers cut \par \par \uc2  19,000 jobs in May, compared with a downwardly revised 182,000 \par \par \uc2  drop in April. The report also showed that the unemployment \par \par \uc2  rate declined to 4.4 percent from 4.5 percent, defying Wall \par \par \uc2  Street economists' expectations of a rise to 4.6 percent. \par \par \uc2  The dollar displayed muted reaction to the National \par \par \uc2  Association of Purchasing Management's May manufacturing \par \par \uc2  survey, released early in the session. The headline index \par \par \uc2  checked in at 42.1 against 43.2 in April. \par \par \uc2  Analysts predicted the euro's weakness will be sustained. \par \par \uc2  "The fundamentals are the euro should weaken against the \par \par \uc2  dollar. Unless we have a complete collapse in (U.S.) markets or \par \par \uc2  something that makes Europe take their money back, it is going \par \par \uc2  to be a long slow grind lower in the euro," said Mark Thome, \par \par \uc2  trader at Fortis U.S.A. \par \par \uc2  "The pressure on the euro is going to remain," said John \par \par \uc2  McCarthy, director of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at ING Barings \par \par \uc2  in New York. "But I don't think we'll see it substantially \par \par \uc2  lower as long as euro/yen stays above 100 yen." \par \par \uc2  Europe's single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell to 84.30 cents in midday U.S. \par \par \uc2  trade EUR=), its lowest since Nov. 27, 2000. It recovered to \par \par \uc2  post gain of 0.26 percent at 84.78 cents. \par \par \uc2  Against Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the euro had fallen as low as \par \par \uc2  99.90 yen during London trade, its deepest trench since \par \par \uc2  December 2000. It climbed back to its highs reached earlier in \par \par \uc2  Asian trade, up 0.35 percent at 101.10 yen EURJPY=). \par \par \uc2  The euro has derived minimal support from a fear that \par \par \uc2  European monetary officials could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its defense by \par \par \uc2  buying euros. Previous \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  occurred in September and \par \par \uc2  November of last year when the euro traded at similar levels. \par \par \uc2  "People are afraid to be short, so once we pushed to lows \par \par \uc2  we saw a bit of a short squeeze," said Michael King, trader at \par \par \uc2  Commerzbank. "But any significant rally should be sold into \par \par \uc2  this." \par \par \uc2  The dollar rose off fresh three-month lows hit against the \par \par \uc2  yen to trade just above break-even at 119.23 yen JPY=). The \par \par \uc2  euro's steep losses vs. the yen has weighed the dollar down. \par \par \uc2  MORE TALK FROM JAPAN DEEPENS EURO'S WOES \par \par \uc2  Shiokawa's comments came a day after European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  Council member Klaus Leibscher and ECB head Wim Duisenberg \par \par \uc2  appeared to rule out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the euro, sending \par \par \uc2  the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to six-month lows against the dollar on \par \par \uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2  But market participants have speculated that remarks out of \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Europe downplaying the prospects of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  could be a red herring to divert the market's attention, and \par \par \uc2  that the central banks could leap in to support the single \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  when traders least expect. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said that such action should not be ruled out \par \par \uc2  given the euro's heavy falls which has translated into \par \par \uc2  staggering yen gains, which could damage the already-fragile \par \par \uc2  economy. \par \par \uc2      "They will need to have exports to revive their economy. \par \par \uc2  The strong yen is really hurting them," said Thome. \par \par \uc2      The talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has revived volatility in euro \par \par \uc2  options. \par \par \uc2      On Friday, the one-month 25-delta risk reversal favored \par \par \uc2  euro puts 0.6/0.2, up a touch from 0.5/0.1 quoted on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Risk reversals are the measure of the volatility bias of puts, \par \par \uc2  or sell options, vs. calls, or buy options. \par \par \uc2  "Shiokawa's comments have led to a feeling that \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely soon," said Arjun Mittal, economist at \par \par \uc2  American Express Bank in London. "But we would say that this \par \par \uc2  does not preclude the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, the dollar displayed muted reaction to the \par \par \uc2  National Association of Purchasing Management's May \par \par \uc2  manufacturing survey, released early in the session. The \par \par \uc2  headline index checked in at 42.1 against 43.2 in April. \par \par \uc2  In other trading, the Canadian dollar edged off its highest \par \par \uc2  level in nearly a month against the dollar, buoyed by data on \par \par \uc2  Thursday showing Canada's gross domestic product rose to an \par \par \uc2  annualized 2.5 percent in the first quarter. It drifted near \par \par \uc2  C$1.5358 CAD=), down 0.13 percent. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6102kbn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
