\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Euro falls as ECB,  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  dampen  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  nerves. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Christina Fincher \par \uc2 495 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Mai 2001\par 09:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, May 31 (Reuters) - The euro shed almost two yen and over half a cent against the dollar on Thursday to test its lowest level this year after officials in \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Europe appeared to play down the prospect of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  jitters eased after European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  council member Klaus Liebscher said conditions now were "completely different" from when the ECB last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and that the euro's exchange rate was only one of a number of risk factors for inflation. \par \par \uc2  His comments came hard on the heels of remarks by Japan's Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa that small daily \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements did not warrant interference. \par \par \uc2  "Comments from both Liebscher and Shiokawa seem to suggest there is no imminent threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Shahab Jalinoos, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at UBS Warburg. \par \par \uc2  "This has made the market feel more comfortable about selling euros, particularly against the yen, without getting their fingers burned." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders - on a heightened state of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  alert ever since the euro fell to six-month lows against the dollar and five-month lows against the yen last week - responded by pushing the euro down almost two percent to 101.25 yen . \par \par \uc2  The euro was also dragged sharply lower against the dollar, making several attempts at the key $0.85 level, but each time meeting resistance and bouncing back. \par \par \uc2  Data showing France's jobless rate was unchanged at 8.7 percent in April despite a surprise increase in the number of unemployed also reinforced the recent picture of slowing euro zone growth, although had little immediate \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  impact. \par \par \uc2  PASSING PHASE \par \par \uc2  The euro's weakness also translated into strength in the yen, which climbed almost one percent to near 119 against the dollar . \par \par \uc2  Traders reported strong selling from Japanese exporters, with one car maker alone rumoured to have sold $1.0 billion. \par \par \uc2  Relative yen strength over the past two months has taken many market players by surprise, since many investors and exporters had believed the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was in a long-term downtrend. \par \par \uc2  But the recent tumble in the euro changed all that. \par \par \uc2  "The slide in euro/yen has caught everyone out," said a European bank dealer. "It forced massive liquidation of short yen positions on a range of crosses and changed the whole psychology of the market." \par \par \uc2  But many agree that the yen's firmness can only be a passing phase, in view of the parlous state of the country's economy. New data on Thursday piled on the misery, with overtime payments in April down 1.5 percent year-on-year, the second straight month of decline. \par \par \uc2  April construction orders and housing starts also fell sharply, while the Nikkei share average also fell nearly two percent on the day. \par \par \uc2  "There is absolutely nothing positive you can say about the yen," said a dealer at a U.S. bank. "Its strength is purely a matter of other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  looking less attractive." \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx5v02pjf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
