\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: Euro To Remain Source Of Market Volatility \b0\par\par\uc2 384 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 2001\par 08:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  The euro also came under pressure against the yen in Asia, as stop-loss selling near Y104.00 sent the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down to below Y103.50. \par \par \uc2  The yen's late rise against the euro helped it advance a bit further against the dollar in late trading. \par \par \uc2  With little supportive factors in sight for the euro, selling is likely to keep pressuring the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and continue "making euro movements a source of volatility for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," said a trader at a Japanese trust bank. \par \par \uc2  But he pointed out that fears of European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may keep the euro from losing ground too rapidly, especially as ECB President Wim Duisemberg raised the issue overnight by saying that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains a weapon in the ECB's arsenal. \par \par \uc2  Top Japanese Finance Ministry bureaucrat Haruhiko Kuroda, who has stressed that the euro's recent weakness against the dollar is out of line with fundamentals, reminded the market yesterday that Japan's stance is to "take appropriate steps if \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates don't reflect fundamentals." \par \par \uc2  Still, it is unlikely that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's MOF and the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on behalf of the euro/yen at current levels, especially before the ECB does, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "Though it has been strengthening due to the weaker euro, the yen is still weaker than it was last November, and would be illogical for Japanese authorities to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at this level," Kokusai's Shioiri said. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, immediate \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the ECB is also unlikely while the euro remains in the mid $0.85s. \par \par \uc2  "Real fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  are unlikely to arise unless the euro falls to the $0.82-level, or at least below the recent low of $0.8480," Shioiri said. \par \par \uc2  In late trading, sterling was at $1.4178, down from $1.4221 in Tokyo Monday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   -By Miyako Takebe, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929;\par miyako.takebe@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The chart of late Tokyo \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates which accompanied Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has\par been replaced with an enhanced \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fixture which is updated\par hourly.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Subscribers can find this table:\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Telerate pages 4046 and 1087.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Dow Jones Newswires by searching the code N/IFX\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Reuters by entering FRX or INT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Bloomberg by entering NI FRX\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx5t02d21\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
