\par\par \b \uc2  CFTC Commitments: Specs Stay Net Short Yen \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Mai 2001\par 22:23\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  CHICAGO -(Dow Jones)- Non-commercial accounts, or speculators, are holding on to their net short positions in Japanese yen \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures at the Chicago Mercantile Exchange Inc., according to the latest Commitment of Traders report from the Commodity Futures Trading Commission. \par \par \uc2  The report, released Friday and updated through Tuesday's session close, showed speculators trimmed positions in both the long and short columns, but remain slightly net short. \par \par \uc2  Non-commercial traders subtracted 871 short yen positions and trimmed long positions by 267 to bring them to a total of 26,429 long and 28,744 short. \par \par \uc2  "Yen is beginning to look technically negative. But on the other hand, it's not likely to drop like a stone because of recent comments out of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's politicians saying that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is possible. Still, the market is likely to grind lower," said Justice Litle, senior futures/options specialist at Commodity Resource Corp., which has a Web site at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.commodity.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.commodity.com}}}\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In EuroFX yen futures, speculators are still net long, although they did add more to their short positions. \par \par \uc2  Non-commercial shorts in EuroFX grew by 2,797 to rise to 10,473 while longs increased by 1,851 to 13,881 contracts. \par \par \uc2  Technical factors show that EuroFX is turning more positive as the market has made some higher lows on daily charts. However, the outlook for the market is muddled as the lack of credibility for the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  gives the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  little support. "They're (ECB) not very good at forecasting their movements," Litle said. \par \par \uc2  -By Debbie Carlson, Dow Jones Newswires; 312-750-4072; debbie.carlson@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010710dx5i00qvn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
