\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dlr pushes up, capped by  \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention \highlight\uc2  threats. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Isabel Reynolds \par \uc2 564 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 April 2001\par 08:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, April 9 (Reuters) - The dollar regained some ground against the yen in unsettled trading on Monday as Japanese equities dipped, but mixed economic data kept the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  confused. \par \par \uc2  The dollar climbed as far as 124.94 yen from late New York levels of 123.82/90 after the Bank of Japan announced that the March domestic wholesale price index (WPI) had dropped 0.5 percent from the previous year. \par \par \uc2  That marked the largest year-on-year drop since December 1999 and apparently indicated the deflationary trend was intact. \par \par \uc2  Japan's benchmark Nikkei average was down more than three percent late in the afternoon session, adding to economic concerns. \par \par \uc2  But the dollar's rise was capped by further yen-supportive statements from the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  MOF KEEPS UP PRESSURE \par \par \uc2  Japan's top financial diplomat, Haruhiko Kuroda, repeated his warning that Japan would take action if recent trends in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market continued, Jiji news agency reported. \par \par \uc2  Economics Minister Taro Aso also chimed in, saying that Japan was not seeking a weaker yen, but wanted stability. \par \par \uc2  Ken Landon, a strategist at Deutsche Bank in Tokyo said the comments were part of a seasonal pattern, in which the government tries to talk the yen down before the end of March book-closing, to increase the value of Japanese companies' foreign assets. It then tends to change its attitude in the new financial year. \par \par \uc2  "They just try to control the speed of it, the Japanese officials. Our main view is still higher...initially breaking above 130 and that could happen within one month," he said. \par \par \uc2  Many analysts see the dollar entering a period of consolidation before making another try for levels above 126.82, which it reached on April 2. \par \par \uc2  Japanese machinery orders were slightly stronger than expected, with core private sector orders reported up 5.0 percent month on month. But this still did not offset the 11.8 percent dip the previous month. \par \par \uc2  The dollar fell on Friday, partly on concerns about a weekend meeting of finance ministers from the Association of South East Asian Nations (ASEAN). \par \par \uc2  ASEAN NO SURPRISE \par \par \uc2  At the end of the two-day meeting in Kuala Lumpur, delegates issued a joint communique that "noted with concern the recent volatility of financial markets and the major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , particularly the depreciation of the Japanese yen". \par \par \uc2  But such a statement had already been factored in by the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  "The communique was not surprising, so the market is refraining from buying the yen further," said Hideaki Furumaya, head of the interbank desk at Mizuho Trust & Banking Co Ltd. \par \par \uc2  The euro managed to stay just above $0.90 as the market continued to speculate about an interest rate cut from the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's next meeting on Thursday. It was trading at $0.9027 in late Tokyo, compared with $0.9038 in late New York on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "Actually we don't think they will cut. We think they are solely focused on the inflation numbers, which are not that good," said Landon. \par \par \uc2  The euro had been encouraged against the dollar on Friday by markedly lower U.S. payroll figures for March, which saw the steepest monthly fall since November 1991. \par \par \uc2  Against the yen the euro was bid at 112.75, up from 111.82 late on Friday in New York. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx4902g5a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
