\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ data confirms no Nov  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2 -bankers. \b0\par\par\uc2 204 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Dezember 2000\par 05:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Dec 1 (Reuters) - Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) account data released on Friday showed the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted no \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in November, bankers said. \par \par \uc2  The data showed the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) received no payments from private financial institutions through its special \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account. \par \par \uc2  Such payments are generally viewed as evidence of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in which the BOJ acts as the Finance Ministry's agent. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on September 22, when it acted in coordination with several other central banks in a bid to support the ailing euro. \par \par \uc2  The European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (ECB) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  three times in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on its own in November, helping the euro to rebound above 96 yen from a lifetime low of 88.93 yen hit in late October. \par \par \uc2  Japanese authorities repeatedly said they were concerned an overly rapid appreciation of the yen would be harmful to Japan's nascent economic recovery and they would act in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if needed. \par \par \uc2  Against the dollar, the yen weakened by more than four percent to 111.54 yen per dollar early this week from its early November highs of less than 107 per dollar. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dwc10bjta\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
